      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, i think you misread my last message or something. i'm asking about structural degradation and moisture, not goblins. can we stick to the technical side? \n\nspecifically, what kind of flashing setups or sealant types do you recommend to prevent that capillary action and moisture trapping you mentioned? i need to know what products to spec for the crew.",
      "source": "evaluator"
